{"title":"Gem Pearl","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher, Dune Marauder</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Elite, 9.1% of recorded drops (1 / 11 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - Normal, 0.7% of recorded drops (1 / 153 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.7%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-pearl\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=1\">1c <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=2\">2c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=2.5\">2.5c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=3\">3c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Pearl found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Wanderer)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>22 <span class=\"muted\">(67%)</span></td><td>61%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Wanderer: ≈0.75% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>4 <span class=\"muted\">(12%)</span></td><td>15%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Wanderer: 2% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(9.1%)</span></td><td>9.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Wanderer: ≈2.25% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(6.1%)</span></td><td>6.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c)</td><td>Wanderer: 3% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>3.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Wanderer: ≈3.75% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>1.4%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Wanderer: 5% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(6.1%)</span></td><td>1.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Wanderer: ≈5.25% more move speed</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-pearl?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.5%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Wanderer: 6% more move speed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">33 Pearl recorded: 32 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 364 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"Gem Pearl\"></div><h3>Gem Pearl</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/7/2026, 9:35:09 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}